  "title": "Implementation of Fair Work First in Scottish Public Procurement Update SPPN 6/2021 | Procurement Journey",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.procurementjourney.scot/implementation-fair-work-first-scottish-public-procurement-update-sppn-62021",
  "description": null,
  "publication_date": null,
